{"id":"influence","lemma":"influence","pos":"noun","rank":2141,"glosses":["influence"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃.fly.ɑ̃s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/Fr-influence.ogg/Fr-influence.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"influences"},"formAudio":{"influences":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-influences.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il a une mauvaise influence.","en":"He's a bad influence.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bad","l":"mauvais"},null]},{"text":"Quelles sont vos influences ?","en":"What are your influences?","words":[{"g":"which","l":"quel"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},null]},{"text":"L'argent influence tout.","en":"Money influences everything.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"money"},null,{"g":"all"}]},{"text":"Notre influence s'est beaucoup étendue depuis lors.","en":"Our sphere of influence has expanded so much since then.","words":[{"g":"our"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"expanse, area"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"since then, ever since"]]},{"text":"L'influence de la science sur la société est grande.","en":"The impact of science on society is great.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null,{"g":"science"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"society"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]}]}